$ graphify install --project --platform hermes
  references       ->  .hermes/skills/graphify/references
  skill installed  ->  .hermes/skills/graphify/SKILL.md
graphify section written to <FIXTURE_ROOT>/project/AGENTS.md

Hermes will now check the knowledge graph before answering
codebase questions and rebuild it after code changes.

Note: unlike Claude Code, there is no PreToolUse hook equivalent for
Hermes — the AGENTS.md rules are the always-on mechanism.

Project-scoped install. Add to version control:
  git add .hermes/ AGENTS.md

